                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-service-support",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Service Support Matters as Much as the Tire Itself",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "service-support"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-support-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the best semi truck tires isn't just about brand or tread; it's about where you get them and who supports them after installation. At Sun State International, parts and service teams work together so you're not bouncing between vendors. When tires are installed, inspected, and maintained by the same trusted team, issues get caught earlier and resolved faster.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-support-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our service departments understand Florida conditions, heavy-duty applications, and the importance of keeping your truck on the road, not waiting in a shop longer than necessary.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/how-to-choose-the-best-semi-truck-tires-for-long-term-hauls/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International service bay exterior with heavy-duty trucks parked outside"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-built-for-reliability",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Built for Reliability, Backed by Experience",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "built-for-reliability"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-built-for-reliability-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you have a business to run, you don't have time for guesswork. You need straightforward advice, dependable parts, and service teams that respect your schedule. That's been part of Sun State International's approach for decades: providing quality transportation products, parts, and services with an unwavering commitment to customer success.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-built-for-reliability-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you're evaluating long-haul truck tires, planning preventative maintenance, or preparing for a full replacement, having a knowledgeable partner makes the difference. If you're ready to choose tires that hold up to Florida heat, long miles, and real-world demands, connect with Sun State International's Parts and Service Departments. From selection to installation, we're here to help you protect your investment and stay confidently on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-built-for-reliability-3",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
